I have packages "A" and "B" in the current directory. "A" depends on "B" and also on "C" where "C" is on CRAN.  install_local("A") will install "A" and also automatically installs "C" but not "B".   Is there any facility in devtools to enable it to pull in "B" automatically too if only told about "A"?

